\title{IntegratedLearner: Integrated multi-omics learning}
\description{
Provides a unified interface for multi-omics prediction using early and
late fusion for continuous, binary, multiclass, and survival outcomes.
The primary user-facing workflow is based on \code{MultiAssayExperiment} and
standard Bioconductor accessors such as \code{experiments()}, \code{assay()},
\code{colData()}, and \code{sampleMap()}, while older PCL-style inputs remain
available for backward compatibility. The package includes utilities for
fitting, prediction, plotting, and model inspection.
